{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:41:58.289Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b78194f57e8012eef3a1beab09fc5ae01d3593430a0bdc456695e0e964f1411f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to you in the #coastal-team thread. In short:\n\n- **Handover:** Bettina Kroll took Saltmarsh Provisions over from you on Monday 6 Oct 2025. Moss's Sunday prep note gives the date but doesn't name the new owner. The name comes from channel messages, where you and Bettina both refer to it as her account.\n- **Discount:** 10%. Bettina posted 12% on 17 Nov 2025, then corrected it within minutes. She had misread June's draft worksheet. I haven't seen the final paperwork, so check it against June's worksheet if the file needs to be exact.\n- **Corinne's admin access:** ticket PD-4827, opened by Kwame on 15 Oct 2025. PD-4824 is a different ticket, about the exception report for the refrigerated loads moved from door 3 to door 4.\n\nBecause you're the account owner, you could see the discount figure. The channel had already posted it, so repeating it there was fine."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
